 666+ 83AD              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 667+ 83AD              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 668+ 83AD              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 669+ 83AD              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 670+ 83AD                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
